From: Mortimer, Squire to Presto
To: Uga-Buga Makumb

  Honored Sovereign, 

  In spring, Presto explored Kumasi well and now 71% of it has been explored.
While adventuring, Presto saw no monsters.
  The wet spring blossomed into a fragrant early summer.  Presto travelled 
throughout Kumasi, exploring its features.  After his exploration efforts, 
100% of it has been explored to date.  Presto discovered an interesting 
feature in Kumasi: a Catacombs (#76) occupied by the Banshee.  What treasure 
may lie there is unknown.  The Banshee is the undead spirit of an evil 
female elf.  Its horrible scream can strike a man dead.  Presto encountered 
no marauding monster.
  Midsummer's day passed and a hot late summer came.  Presto travelled to 
the Falkland Sea.  During his travels this season, he was unexpectedly 
approached by a Renegade Necromancer.  But Presto spoke to 
the Renegade Necromancer with friendly words, and a fight was averted.

  With the coming of the fall season, Presto roamed through the Falkland Sea,
exploring the terrain there, and now 100% of it has been explored.  In his 
travels, he encountered no monsters.
  In early winter, Presto tried to explore the Falkland Sea but it seemed 
that it had already been completely explored.  In his travels, he saw no 
monster.

  Thy humble servant,   Mortimer, Squire to Presto


From: Tattoo, Squire to Magnus
To: Uga-Buga Makumb

  Honored Sovereign, 

  Winter melted into spring.  Magnus tried to improve his Sageness, but the 
