  Thy humble servant,   Tattoo, Squire to Magnus


From: Clarambald
To: Uga-Buga Makumb

  Honored Sovereign, 

  Stormy winter gave way to fragrant spring, and I made ready to carry out 
my imperial orders.  I journeyed to Cretacia.
  With the advent of the early summer season, I enlisted the 145th Garrison 
and the 146th Garrison in Cretacia to serve the provincial garrison 
commander.
  In late summer, I moved into Cherrywood.
  The summer mellowed into the fall.  I levied the 18th Garrison from among 
