  My lord and sovereign, greatest of Kings, I humbly beg thy leave to make
report of matters of this Kingdom that may concern thy divine majesty.


DIPLOMACY 

  My lord, the following Kings have wisely allied with thy ever-
victorious majesty:                    

  Babba Sissoko (#0), 215g taxbase is of Undead alignment.


  My lord, the following Kings are foolishly at war with thy ever-
victorious majesty:                    

