  Prometeo (#5), 14g taxbase
  Kahn (#6), 13g taxbase
  Giovanna d'Arco (#7)
  Circe (#8), 0g taxbase


  My lord, the following Kings are cautiously neutral with thy ever-
victorious majesty:                    

